      "description": "KTH - Your future workplace |  KTH kth.se kth.se Student web Intranet kth.se Student web Intranet Login Skip to main content Studies Studies close Research Research close Collaboration Collaboration close About KTH About KTH close Library Library close Close Studies Close Research Close Collaboration Close About KTH Close Library Close Main menu Close Studies Main menu Close Research Main menu Close Collaboration Main menu Close About KTH Main menu Close Library Search Search the KTH website Search Search the Student web Search the Intranet Svenska Menu KTH About KTH Work at KTH KTH - Your future workplace At KTH, we shape the future through education, research, and innovation. Here, you will be part of a dynamic and creative environment, collaborating with dedicated colleagues while developing both professionally and personally. We offer excellent conditions and benefits – and above all, the opportunity to contribute to a sustainable societal development. KTH is located in Stockholm, one of the world’s most innovative cities, offering the best of both vibrant city life and easy access to nature. Join us in shaping the future! Apply for a job at KTH Vacancies Work and develop at KTH Positions at KTH Staff development Benefits Scholarships Relocation services Be part of KTH Facts about KTH News from KTH An international university Available positions Would you like to be part of a leading technical university and contribute to shaping a sustainable society? At KTH, both individuals and innovation thrive. Together, we drive knowledge forward. Vacancies at KTH HR Excellence in Research KTH is certified with the EU’s HR Excellence in Research award – a mark of quality that demonstrates our systematic efforts to be a responsible and attractive employer for researchers at all career stages. HR Excellence in Research Did you know that... KTH is not only the largest university in Sweden for engineering education and research, but also a place full of exciting and unexpected features. Did you know that... You have previously denied the display of content of the type \"External media\". Do you want to show content? Yes Always Join KTH At KTH, you become part of a team that drives education and research at the forefront, with a strong focus on sustainable societal development. Here, you collaborate with colleagues and partners in an inclusive and international environment that fosters shared progress and personal growth. Equality and diversity Gender equality and the rejection of all forms of discrimination are both a quality-assurance issue and a self-evident component of KTH’s core values. Equality, diversity and inclusion Sustainable development At KTH, we are driven by the ambition to enable a sustainable society and take an active role in shaping the transition to a sustainable, climate-neutral world. Environment and sustainable development World-class innovation support KTH is home to nearly 500 spin-off companies, and KTH Innovation is recognized as one of Europe’s leading hubs for innovation. Thanks to the teacher exemption , you retain full ownership of your ideas. KTH Innovation Follow us Follow KTH in social media for the latest research news, exciting events, and more. Follow KTH in social media Page responsible: rekryteringssystem@kth.se Belongs to : About KTH Last changed : Oct 14, 2025 KTH Study at KTH Research Cooperation About KTH Student at KTH Alumni KTH Intranet Organisation KTH Library KTH Schools Competence centres President and management University Administration Services Timetables Course and programme directory Webmail Learning management system (Canvas) Contact KTH Royal Institute of Technology SE-100 44 Stockholm Sweden +46 8 790 60 00 Contact KTH Work at KTH Press and media About KTH website To page top This website uses services that may store information about you and how you use the website. Some services are necessary for the website to work, and others are optional. Manage services 